flowchart LR
    A[User question] --> B[Embed query]
    B --> C[Vector search top-k]
    C --> D[Hybrid: + keyword BM25]
    D --> E[Rerank cross-encoder]
    E --> F[Assemble context + citations]
    F --> G[Prompt LLM]
    G --> H[Grounded answer]
    H --> I{Evidence sufficient?}
    I -- No --> J[Refuse or ask / escalate]
    I -- Yes --> K[Return answer + sources]
    K --> L[Log feedback]
    L -.improve retrieval.-> C
